#: '' '''N'y a-t-il''' rien à faire ?''
#:: '' '''Isn't there''' anything to do?''

====Usage notes====
* This fragment is typically used either with a negative adverb, such as {{m|fr|pas}} or {{m|fr|jamais}}, or with a negative object, such as {{m|fr|rien}}. Hence "N'y a-t-il pas de fruits ?", "N'y a-t-il rien à faire ?", and so on. See ''{{l|fr|ne}}''.

